OL,3,GNEWSAFreshers' flu left me profoundly
OL,4,Adeaf in both ears
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Darcie Parker turned up for her
OL,7,Ffirst day at university, she had no
OL,8,Fidea a case of freshers' flu would
OL,9,Fleave her profoundly deaf in both ears.
OL,11,FThe 22-year-old, from Dronfield in
OL,12,FDerbyshire, said she assumed not being
OL,13,Fable to hear was part of the illness
OL,14,Fbut was told by medics a week later
OL,15,Fthat her hearing would not come back.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
