OL,3,GNEWSAFreshers' flu left me profoundly
OL,4,Adeaf in both ears
OL,5,
OL,6,FDarcie went on to complete her degree
OL,7,Fat The Academy of Contemporary Music in
OL,8,FBirmingham, trained to become a
OL,9,Fteacher, and later passed her driving
OL,10,Ftest... following the challenging task
OL,11,Fof finding someone willing to teach
OL,12,Fher.
OL,14,FNow she has partnered with her driving
OL,15,Finstructor to create a course about
OL,16,Fteaching deaf people how to drive.
